        "subtitle": "Ergonomic Manual Positioning with Integrated 15° Tilt Dynamics",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Durable construction is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the ultra-clean finish and surface integrity of Poly-Comfort, perform routine wiping down with non-abrasive sanitizers formulated for professional spa environments between each client. The ultra-resistant leatherette surface resists oil build-up and staining, ensuring pristine visual presentation across years of intensive clinic operations. Consistent care preserves material flexibility, prevents surface cracking, and upholds hygienic presentation.</p>",
