            "answer": "<p>For the practicing Esthetician conducting multi-step facials, maintaining comfortable posture while reaching the face and décolleté is essential during extended treatment sessions. The integrated 15° seat tilt system rotates the base back, bringing the client’s facial features closer to the operator. This structural adjustment stabilizes practitioner mechanics, keeping hands precise during delicate extraction or chemical peel procedures.</p>"
